@startuml
title Trusted publication of artifact and SBOM

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 15
}

rectangle "Build environment" as BUILD
rectangle "SBOM generator" as GEN
rectangle "Signing service / PKI" as PKI
database "Trusted artifact repository" as REPO
actor "Release manager" as RM
actor "Customer / Auditor" as CA

BUILD --> GEN : compiled artifact,\npackage metadata
GEN --> PKI : SBOM + hashes
PKI --> REPO : signed SBOM,\nsigned artifact,\nprovenance
RM --> REPO : publish release
CA --> REPO : download and verify
CA --> PKI : validate signature chain

note bottom of REPO
Immutable storage,
access control,
audit trail
end note

@enduml
